Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.00,Default SEED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8\fad(500,500)}本字幕來源互聯網  原製作者： HSQ-Rip
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.00,0:00:10.00,Default SEED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8\fad(500,500)}感謝字幕組及製作字幕個人的辛勤勞動與付出
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.00,0:00:15.00,Default SEED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8\fad(500,500)}字幕時間軸由kewenyu調整以適應當前作品
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.96,0:00:08.57,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,右舵2度 再減速20%
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.76,0:00:11.34,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,右舵2度 再減速20%
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.55,0:00:15.28,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,初島自動管制員通告全部門
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.31,0:00:17.35,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Zulu Alpha確認抵達
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.41,0:00:22.28,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,今後Zulu Alpha與導航頻道Bravo的人工智慧連接
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.46,0:00:24.14,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,入港程式開始
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.09,0:00:30.79,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,紮夫特的最新戰艦密涅瓦
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.09,0:00:34.09,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,公主又搭乘這種麻煩的東西回國
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.70,0:00:36.88,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,沒辦法 父親
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.25,0:00:41.53,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,卡嘉莉也不會料到事情發展成那樣吧
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.79,0:00:47.12,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,也不能冷落了送國家元首回來的艦船 現在
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.58,0:00:49.41,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯 現在是這樣
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.93,0:02:28.98,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,卡嘉莉
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.34,0:02:31.14,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,尤拉
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.95,0:02:37.65,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,沒事就好 擔心死我了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.90,0:02:41.66,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,那個 對不起
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.12,0:02:45.90,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我說尤拉 心情可以理解但要看場合
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.10,0:02:48.67,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,紮夫特的各位都看著呢
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.39,0:02:50.28,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,烏納特·艾瑪
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.28,0:02:53.01,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,一路辛苦了 首相代表
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.95,0:02:58.70,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,能見到您平安歸來我們總算放心了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.18,0:03:01.15,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,重要的場合不在非常抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.67,0:03:03.92,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,感謝諸位留守時的工作
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.64,0:03:06.59,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,受害情況如何
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.90,0:03:10.02,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,沿岸區域受到了大浪襲擊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.02,0:03:12.16,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,所幸奧布沒有受到直接衝擊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.64,0:03:15.82,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,詳細情況稍後到行政府再說
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.34,0:03:20.81,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,紮夫特軍密涅瓦艦長 塔里婭·庫拉堤絲
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.25,0:03:24.03,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,同屬大副 亞瑟·特萊茵
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.20,0:03:27.73,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,奧布聯合首相國宰相 烏納特·艾瑪·賽蘭
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.70,0:03:32.32,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,感謝你們護送首相安全歸來
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.68,0:03:36.07,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不 雖然事出突然
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.15,0:03:41.10,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我們對給阿斯哈首相造成的困擾表示遺憾
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.98,0:03:46.55,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,同時向貴國遭受的災害表示慰問
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.09,0:03:49.02,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,多謝好意
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.58,0:03:52.20,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,總之 先安心休息一下吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.80,0:03:54.19,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,情況已略知一二
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.68,0:03:57.34,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,諸位乘員也一定累了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.83,0:03:59.08,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,非常感謝
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.20,0:04:01.97,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,先去行政府
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.59,0:04:04.73,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,剛剛回國難為您了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.07,0:04:07.86,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但有很多事必須報告
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.24,0:04:09.71,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯 我明白
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.31,0:04:18.29,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,你也辛苦了 阿雷克斯
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.57,0:04:21.76,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,保護卡嘉莉幹得不錯 多謝
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.05,0:04:22.68,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.01,0:04:27.39,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,報告書不急 你也休息吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.31,0:04:31.92,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,今後也許還需要你負責和他們的過渡工作
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.30,0:04:32.96,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.38,0:04:34.77,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,那個...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.04,0:04:47.85,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不知道到底打什麼算盤呢
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.75,0:04:52.46,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,賽蘭原本就偏向大西洋聯邦
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.86,0:04:56.39,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,就算卡嘉莉回來 現在的情況...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.13,0:04:58.22,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.56,0:05:04.03,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,總之事情鬧大了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.64,0:05:11.57,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,說什麼？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.98,0:05:15.30,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,和大西洋聯邦締結新同盟條約？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.04,0:05:18.32,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這個時期怎麼還提出這種話題
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.84,0:05:22.46,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,現在對受災地區的救助才是正題吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.60,0:05:25.22,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,正因為是這種時期
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.40,0:05:29.74,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,而且這不是和大西洋聯邦
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.46,0:05:34.22,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,提出倡議的的確是大西洋聯邦一方
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.68,0:05:37.85,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但這是對地球上所有國家
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.99,0:05:44.20,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,約定中當然也包括了對受災地區的救援工作
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.80,0:05:49.92,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這樣反而會提高救災工作的效率
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.24,0:05:51.49,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不 但是...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.27,0:05:55.78,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,首相也許因為一直乘坐紮夫特的艦船
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.88,0:05:59.50,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,對眼下情況尚未完全瞭解
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.96,0:06:06.80,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,地球遭受的損失是非常嚴重的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.60,0:06:08.87,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,而這個
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.14,0:06:16.40,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我們住在地球上的人都已經家喻戶曉
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.60,0:06:19.72,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這...這種東西怎麼會...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.51,0:06:26.14,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,大西洋聯邦來的情報
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.73,0:06:31.28,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但PLANT也已經大致承認這是事實
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.32,0:06:34.61,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,首相似乎也知道啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.03,0:06:41.83,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但那只是一小部分恐怖分子所為
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.99,0:06:47.30,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,在PLANT 瞭解事態的狄蘭達爾議長和密涅瓦乘員們
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.48,0:06:50.15,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,在粉碎工作上傾盡了全力
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.85,0:06:53.44,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,所以地球才能...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.78,0:06:55.64,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這當然也明白
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.04,0:06:59.94,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但您敢對受災的幾千萬民眾這樣說嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.08,0:07:03.14,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,你們雖然遭了難
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.26,0:07:06.20,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但地球得救了 就原諒他們吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.65,0:07:12.93,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,無法饒恕 為什麼能做出這麼慘無人道的事
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.76,0:07:16.26,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,他們打算把我們殺光
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.10,0:07:21.69,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,兒子找不到了 只剩我一個人
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.17,0:07:24.98,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,媽媽呢 媽媽呢
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.71,0:07:28.05,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,果然是這樣
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.33,0:07:33.26,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,調整者那些傢伙也就把我們當猴子看待了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.99,0:07:38.13,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,都是他們的錯
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.34,0:07:42.22,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,打倒PLANT 也讓他們嘗嘗這種滋味
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.52,0:07:44.86,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,為了藍色清淨的世界
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.96,0:07:48.02,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,對 為了藍色清淨的世界
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.32,0:07:50.93,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,為了藍色清淨的世界
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.86,0:07:54.50,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,現在讓他們看到這些的話
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.72,0:07:57.96,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,地球上不會有人能忍氣吞聲
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.19,0:08:01.68,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,幸虧奧布受災並不嚴重
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.40,0:08:06.67,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,所以我們更應該謹慎從事
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.82,0:08:09.36,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,理念雖然重要
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.58,0:08:13.60,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但必須清楚我們現在該和誰分擔痛苦
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.22,0:08:18.05,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,首相也請三思一下
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.34,0:08:48.40,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊 艦體方面交給曙光社應該沒問題
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.94,0:08:51.50,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但艦內全都由你們來
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.90,0:08:52.41,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.82,0:08:55.12,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,對方肯出借器材和儀器
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.51,0:08:57.09,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,儘量委婉些
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.98,0:09:01.99,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但這樣好嗎 艦長
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.98,0:09:04.34,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,暫且不說補給
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.68,0:09:09.72,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,艦船修理方面等回到卡潘塔里亞基地也不晚吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.20,0:09:12.11,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,知道你想說什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.65,0:09:14.96,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,要不然在航海日誌裏也寫一筆？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.38,0:09:16.48,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不 那個...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.70,0:09:19.33,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,比起機密更重要的是艦船的安全
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.67,0:09:21.23,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是這樣吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.97,0:09:24.24,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,艦船 特別是戰艦
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.38,0:09:27.50,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不時刻保持值得信賴的狀態會很辛苦吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.72,0:09:28.51,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,指揮官們
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.51,0:09:29.08,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是誰
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.34,0:09:36.90,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,失禮了 曙光社造船B課的瑪利亞·貝爾納斯
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.14,0:09:39.41,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,請讓我負責這裏的工作
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.52,0:09:45.41,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我是艦長塔里婭·庫拉堤絲
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.76,0:09:46.58,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,請多關照
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.23,0:09:52.92,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,雖然聽說密涅瓦還沒舉行入水儀式
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.35,0:09:56.64,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,卻讓人感覺已經久經戰火
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.04,0:09:59.08,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯 非常遺憾
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.02,0:10:03.12,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這點我也始料未及
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.20,0:10:08.38,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,事已至此 也沒辦法
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.00,0:10:14.12,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不過也習慣了 誰都不知道將來會發生什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.12,0:10:16.90,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,特別是現在
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.22,0:10:19.30,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.24,0:10:26.72,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,奧布其實也沒什麼餘力幫助紮夫特修理艦船吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.56,0:10:31.24,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,也許的確是這樣
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.12,0:10:33.42,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但都一樣
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.12,0:10:37.58,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,還是因為不知道將來會發生什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.32,0:10:42.73,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我們也只能做現在相信的事
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.53,0:10:46.47,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,事後如果知道錯了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.07,0:10:50.13,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,到那時候該哭的哭該鬧的鬧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.91,0:10:53.31,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,然後會再考慮下一次
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.31,0:10:56.14,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,也對
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.58,0:11:06.77,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,真的？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.06,0:11:09.17,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不 還沒確認
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.89,0:11:11.94,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,修理要花幾天的話
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.16,0:11:13.91,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,說不定能出去
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.26,0:11:15.21,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,會有上岸許可
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.98,0:11:19.50,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,正好最近都那麼緊張
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.96,0:11:21.77,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,雖然有全身心投入
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.87,0:11:23.75,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,其實快崩潰了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.10,0:11:25.96,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,對了 說到奧布...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.32,0:11:44.64,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,上岸...能批准嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.37,0:11:46.02,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.35,0:12:09.88,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,基拉？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.98,0:12:13.74,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這邊這邊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.31,0:12:19.46,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,阿斯蘭
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.49,0:12:21.10,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不是啦 是阿雷克斯
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.12,0:12:22.13,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是阿斯蘭啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.15,0:12:23.03,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,阿雷克斯
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.05,0:12:24.57,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,你出門了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.59,0:12:25.26,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,去了哪里
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.28,0:12:26.21,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,卡嘉莉呢
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.71,0:12:29.43,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,阿斯蘭
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.65,0:12:33.70,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,你回來了 很辛苦吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.58,0:12:35.61,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,你們才是
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.03,0:12:38.41,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,聽說家園被沖毀搬到這裏了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.09,0:12:40.23,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,沒事嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.53,0:12:42.32,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊 家都沒了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.34,0:12:43.71,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,跟你說 雖然沒看到
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.73,0:12:45.79,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,突然來了這麼大的海嘯
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.79,0:12:46.61,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,都七零八落了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.61,0:12:48.16,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,玩具也都沒了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.16,0:12:50.44,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,說新的造好前要搬家
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.44,0:12:52.39,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,對啊 要搬家
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.71,0:12:54.78,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,大家稍微等等吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.55,0:12:57.53,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這樣都沒法說話了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.49,0:13:01.26,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,卡嘉莉呢
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.37,0:13:06.32,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,在行政府 工作堆積如山吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.03,0:13:10.21,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,基拉先走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.73,0:13:13.87,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我和孩子們從海邊走回去
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.19,0:13:22.75,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,墜落事件的真相大家都知道了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.78,0:13:27.54,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,其中一個傢伙說了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.11,0:13:31.61,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,「忘記被無情粉碎的生命哀號」
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.91,0:13:34.93,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,「為何還與罪魁禍首在虛偽的世界發笑」
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.95,0:13:36.31,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,「你們這些傢伙」
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.60,0:13:41.44,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,參戰了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.27,0:13:48.81,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,去幫忙Junius7的粉碎作業時
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.95,0:13:50.09,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,他們就出現了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.30,0:14:05.89,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,那時候 我問過你
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.77,0:14:08.32,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,就在這奧布...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.44,0:14:15.65,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,「我們到底應該和什麼、如何戰鬥才對」
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.57,0:14:19.88,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,而你回答了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.33,0:14:22.83,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,「大家一起去尋找這答案吧」
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.96,0:14:29.15,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但是...果然還是沒找到
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.18,0:14:59.87,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,阿斯蘭
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.75,0:15:01.45,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,早上好
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.75,0:15:06.58,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,昨天抱歉 一直讓你在行政府等...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.70,0:15:09.87,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,今天也是一大早就要內閣會議
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.97,0:15:11.83,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,都沒好好跟你談
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.27,0:15:12.97,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,那個...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.77,0:15:15.28,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,沒事 我明白
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.98,0:15:16.87,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,你別介意
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.89,0:15:21.22,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,倒是奧布政府的情況怎樣了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.18,0:15:26.98,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.85,0:15:31.89,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,現在情勢那樣發展也是沒辦法
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.59,0:15:34.35,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,雖然和別國相比算是輕微
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.61,0:15:36.29,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,奧布也蒙受了損失
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.47,0:15:39.18,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,首長們說的我也明白
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.04,0:15:42.42,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但是 分擔痛苦
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.00,0:15:45.77,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,絕不是和那些叫囂著報復的人們一起
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.93,0:15:48.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,去憎恨PLANT
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.78,0:15:50.91,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,去哪里呢
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.72,0:15:52.81,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我肚子餓了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.28,0:15:57.95,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,真？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.14,0:16:00.30,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不在嗎 真
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.49,0:16:13.56,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我要去PLANT
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.48,0:16:17.51,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,奧布這種情況下 抱歉了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.15,0:16:21.10,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我也不能獨自在這裏悠然自得了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.50,0:16:22.31,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,阿斯蘭
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.98,0:16:24.48,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但是你會...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.92,0:16:26.76,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我擔心PLANT的情勢
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.99,0:16:35.67,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,狄蘭達爾議長雖然不太可能走上最壞的道路
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.15,0:16:38.80,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但現在還有那樣被父親...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.84,0:16:42.38,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,被父親的話蒙蔽的人
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.42,0:16:47.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,去和議長談談 如果我...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.70,0:16:49.94,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,如果我也能盡一份力的話
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.83,0:16:52.34,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,作為阿斯蘭·薩拉也好
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.54,0:16:53.93,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,作為阿雷克斯也罷
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.48,0:16:59.01,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這樣下去若PLANT和地球再度對立
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.85,0:17:04.80,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我們至今為止所做的事都會失去意義
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.30,0:17:24.17,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不想上岸嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.59,0:17:25.69,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,批准下來了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.86,0:17:44.46,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,雖然尤拉·羅馬的事我也明白
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.20,0:17:48.65,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,還是...感覺無趣
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.81,0:18:10.91,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,哪有這樣給戒指的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.75,0:18:13.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,對不起了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.18,0:18:22.53,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,小心點 要多聯繫
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.16,0:18:24.88,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,卡嘉莉也是 加油
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.11,0:19:29.64,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,嗨 我是瑪尤
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.12,0:19:33.64,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但是抱歉 現在瑪尤不能接聽
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.06,0:19:37.83,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,稍後聯繫 請在信號音後留下姓名
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.30,0:19:40.85,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,沒事的 目標是軍事設施吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.14,0:19:41.85,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,趕緊 真
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.14,0:19:44.93,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,瑪尤 加油
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.69,0:20:27.11,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,慰靈碑 是嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.94,0:20:30.59,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯 看來是
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.71,0:20:33.04,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,也不太清楚
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.42,0:20:38.98,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我也是第一次 一個人特地來
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.72,0:20:42.44,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,難得開了花
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.36,0:20:46.15,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,被浪打到 又會枯萎吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.83,0:20:54.46,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,說明無法掩飾
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.64,0:20:58.53,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,無論花開得多漂亮
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.37,0:21:00.82,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,人總會將其摧毀
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.46,0:21:02.18,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,你...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.39,0:21:11.31,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,對不起 我失言了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.01,0:21:27.97,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這不可能
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.71,0:21:30.41,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,一定是哪里弄錯了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.63,0:21:32.98,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不 沒錯
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.70,0:21:38.49,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,方才以大西洋聯邦和歐亞為首的聯合國
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.79,0:21:41.79,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,發表了「以下要求未被接受的情況下」
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.07,0:21:46.45,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,「即視PLANT為地球人類的最噁心敵對國」
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.89,0:21:49.84,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,「並不惜以武力將其清除」
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.00,0:21:51.75,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這樣的共同聲明
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.34,0:23:28.30,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,在保護的名義下釋放的炮火
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.55,0:23:33.24,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,明知交織的戰火間不會有和平 為何
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.55,0:23:36.71,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,阿斯蘭的呼號那樣空虛
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.07,0:23:39.66,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,天空再次被恐怖的光芒照亮
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.58,0:23:44.52,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,下回 機動戰士GUNDAM SEED DESTINY
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.11,0:23:46.26,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,傲慢的獠牙
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.18,0:23:49.77,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,保護PLANT的和平吧 GuAIZ
